    "subject": "#007 修复: 批量迁移 14 个独立验证脚本到 tools/",
    "context": "#007",
    "content": "## 问题\n以下 14 个文件均为独立验证脚本（`require('playwright')` + 顶层 IIFE），非 `@playwright/test` 格式，残留在 `playwright/` 中会逐个阻塞 `npx playwright test --list`。\n\n## 修复\n全部移入 `AgentTeams/qa/tools/`，改名为 `.verify.js`：\n\n```bash\ncd AgentTeams/qa/playwright\n\nfor f in \\\n  test-applytheme-css-inject.spec.js \\\n  test-columnselector-restore.spec.js \\\n  test-config-security.spec.js \\\n  test-defaulttheme-css-vars.spec.js \\\n  test-getappcontext-stub.spec.js \\\n  test-getdefaulttheme-stub.spec.js \\\n  test-hrmtoken-loop.spec.js \\\n  test-https-http-fix.spec.js \\\n  test-menubuttons-passthrough.spec.js \\\n  test-newfenluapibase-fix.spec.js \\\n  test-openpage-stub.spec.js \\\n  test-port-fix.spec.js \\\n  test-postmessage.spec.js \\\n  test-states-shared.spec.js\ndo\n  newname=$(echo \"$f\" | sed 's/\.spec\.js$/.verify.js/')\n  mv \"$f\" \"../tools/$newname\"\ndone\n```\n\n## 涉及文件\n- 上述 14 个文件\n\n## 验证标准\n- `npx playwright test --list` 不崩溃，只列出真正的 Playwright 测试\n- 14 个文件从 `playwright/` 移除\n- `tools/` 目录下所有 `.verify.js` 语法正确",
